## Maintenance

The Architect keeps the thesis and the cascade true as the taxonomy evolves, and flags any change to
the naming/structure for David (identity- and structure-affecting; not changed unilaterally). The
machine-readable form of the cascade is `profile/composeplatform-profile.yaml` — edit that registry
when a layer/family/domain changes and reconcile this narration to it.

